{"id":"wb-6-749","name":"黑龙潭古建筑群","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T13:25:15+00:00","status":"ready","title":"丽江黑龙潭","text":"丽江黑龙潭公园也称玉泉公园，位于云南省丽江市古城区丽江古城北部，总占地面积625.3万平方米，海拔2419米，为世界文化遗产－丽江古城的一部分。黑龙潭泉群主要由象山东麓的九子海洼地及其周边山系的泉水补给，潭水经玉河向南流入丽江古城，是丽江古城水系的主要来源。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E4%B8%BD%E6%B1%9F%E9%BB%91%E9%BE%99%E6%BD%AD","revisionId":93899211,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=93899211","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"复核百科重定向、文物名称与同一地点；引用版本已锁定","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/a8c2d9743001b53c736a2c2a.jpg","title":"丽江黑龙潭_07.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E4%B8%BD%E6%B1%9F%E9%BB%91%E9%BE%99%E6%BD%AD_07.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/3e/%E4%B8%BD%E6%B1%9F%E9%BB%91%E9%BE%99%E6%BD%AD_07.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"madras91","license":"CC BY 2.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/2.0","caption":"​丽江黑龙潭","width":320,"height":213,"matchEvidence":"已复核文物对应百科条目的主图","subject":"丽江黑龙潭"}}